                "description": "The Providence Knob with Regular Rose is as traditional as it comes. This classic design has been a long standing favorite in home decor for its timelessness. The Providence Knobset with Regular Rose has many finish color options to choose from. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n\r\n",
